<title>FINLAND: TABLE - FINNISH COMPANIES' INTERIM RESULTS AND FORECASTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FINNISH COMPANIES' INTERIM RESULTS AND FORECASTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' forecasts for Finnish</p>
<p>companies' latest results, and published earnings:</p>
<p>For most companies, figures are profit after financial</p>
<p>items, before extraordinary items and tax (for Nokia, profit</p>
<p>before tax and minorities).</p>
<p>For banks, figures are operating profit after credit losses.</p>
<p>The list will be updated as reports and forecasts are published</p>
<p>(* denotes new entry).</p>
<p>(all figures million markka)</p>
<p>	  SIX-MONTH RESULT (to end-June)</p>
